PASS Standalone Blazor WASM starts from static hosting with no renderer Node runtime or desktop path UI.
PASS The actual OS folder picker grants a live external vault, including binary attachment inventory.
PASS Real CodeMirror typing and Ctrl+S preserve exact UTF-8 BOM, CRLF and Unicode in the original file.
PASS External LF/CRLF changes reconfigure CodeMirror without changing the next save's line-ending style.
PASS The shared note-creation UI creates folders and writes a new Markdown note directly to disk.
PASS Desktop-only plugins are unavailable and Node-dependent plugins fail visibly without executing past require.
PASS Core enablement and the unchanged upstream sample plugin save settings into the selected vault.
PASS Page reload reconnects an IndexedDB directory handle and restores layout, core state and exact disk content.
PASS External edits refresh clean buffers; stale saves fail without overwriting disk or discarding unsaved text.
PASS A real page reload is blocked while a buffer has unsaved changes.
PASS Cancelling the native folder picker retains the selected vault and dirty buffer.
PASS Vault switching isolates core settings, and Create vault creates a real subfolder in the selected parent.
PASS A new vault required explicit community-plugin opt-in, stored separately without creating or resetting an enabled-ID file.
LIMIT Photo.avif was not generated: this host exposes no WebCodecs AV1 encoder, so AVIF decoding is unverified here.
PASS Real decoders produced non-placeholder natural sizes for Pixel.png, Anim.gif, Photo.jpg, Photo.webp with exact bytes preserved.
PASS Raster zoom control changes the reported scale (1.25).
PASS SVG: valid renders at its declared size; script/handlers/foreignObject/remote refs/javascript: links are removed and reported (event handler, <script> element, style with external or unsafe resources, <foreignObject> element, external reference); dimensionless, malformed and DOCTYPE/ENTITY files are explicit errors, never a 300x150 decode.
PASS PDF renders to a real canvas with the engine-reported page count (3) and sampled page pixels.
PASS Page and zoom controls re-render distinct pages and persist in view state.
PASS Exact encoded #page/#zoom link targets navigate; invalid targets are rejected: PDF page must be a whole number of 1 or more.
PASS Encrypted PDF prompts, reports an incorrect password, then renders with the correct one.
PASS Malformed and non-PDF .pdf bytes produce explicit error states, not a blank success.
PASS A 14400x14400pt page is capped (4091x4091) instead of exhausting memory.
PASS PDF JavaScript OpenAction did not run and is reported as blocked.
PASS PDF source bytes unchanged after viewing.
PASS Opening a PDF beside a dirty Markdown note leaves the unsaved note text intact.
PASS External modification of the open PDF reloads the viewer (1 page).
PASS Renaming the open PDF keeps the leaf on the new path.
PASS Deleting the open PDF externally leaves no stale rendered success state.
LIMIT Read-only viewing is verified by toggling the vault's read-only flag in the page; no real GitHub read-only vault was used.
PASS Generated WebM decodes with the host's software decoder at 64x48 with native controls and persisted rate/mute state. No other codec or device is claimed.
PASS Bare and fragment links open media files; a locked-PDF #page=99 fails visibly after unlock instead of clamping.
PASS A bare reading-view md link opens the PDF without a fragment error.
PASS Switching video files installs the incoming rate/volume/mute instead of the outgoing file's state.
PASS The open image leaf is restored and decoded again after a restart.
